### 3. Saving and Retrieving User Data
On the final page, upload the profile picture to Storage, then save all data (including weight, height, and body type) to Firestore.

#### A. Final Signup Logic
```dart
Future<void> _completeSignup() async {
  UserCredential user = await FirebaseAuth.instance.createUserWithEmailAndPassword(
    email: email, password: password);

  String uid = user.user!.uid;

  // Upload Image
  Reference ref = FirebaseStorage.instance.ref().child('profiles/$uid.jpg');
  await ref.putFile(_imageFile!);
  String imageUrl = await ref.getDownloadURL();

  // Save to Firestore
  await FirebaseFirestore.instance.collection('users').doc(uid).set({
    'firstName': firstName, 'lastName': lastName,
    'weight': double.parse(_weightController.text),
    'height': double.parse(_heightController.text),
    'bodyType': _selectedBodyType,
    'profilePic': imageUrl,
